@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5080
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Health does not require Supabase settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Players requires Supabase server configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/players

### Fantasy routes require a valid Supabase access token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fantasy/team
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Save a team after replacing picks with all 15 selected players
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fantasy/team
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teamName": "My Touchline XI",
  "formation": "4-4-2",
  "picks": []
}

### Create a league after the user has saved a team
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fantasy/leagues
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Friends League"
}
